ads,head_k,head_v) such that Qwen3.5's [k,k,v,v]-shard packing works with adjusted strides? Freeform should read the kernel source before patching candidate 3.\",\n65\t    \"Config-only probe not proposed this round (budget): --mamba-cache-dtype bfloat16 (GDN conv+ssm states go BF16; FUSED_GDN_STATE_DTYPES allows bf16; bandwidth-bound 48-layer state I/O at conc=64) — worth a slot next round if accuracy gate tolerates; check RecipeKB for prior GDN-state-dtype pitfalls first.\",\n66\t    \"If the unified-attn variant benches positive, should the CDNA3-only gate in _get_backend_priorities be replaced with the gfx9-inclusive is_aiter_attention_supported() (or an arch check inside the backend) as the durable upstream-style bridge instead of the per-launch flag?\"\n67\t  ]\n68\t }\n69\t}\n70\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7b6e3ef5-b0c7-496b-90c6-6145c7215f12","uuid":"b1d9f7e6-fb76-4fea-b414-1d22f0b45f32","timestamp":"2026-09-14T18:51:42.584Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/qiba/ROCm.AI/hyperloom/session/Qwen3.8-27B-ABLITERATED-W8A8-gdnint8/20260914T173139Z-3ae15c89/runs/specialist/26d8322fb812499fb429efc87b5cc792/specialist_done.json","content":"{\n \"intent_type\": \"specialist_done\",\n \"payload\": {\n  \"confidence\": 0.7,\n  \"domain\": \"static_recon_specialist\",\n  \"empty\": false,\n  \"gap_canonical_id\": \"gap.static_recon.prelude\",\n  \"summary\": \"Recon of the LIVE serving tree (/opt/envs/wu1w/.../vllm via vllm-wu1w launcher; NOT /opt/envs/vllm) for gfx90a + INT8-W8A8 + bf16 Qwen3.5 hybrid-GDN. Baseline log confirms AiterInt8ScaledMMLinearKernel is already bridged+selected (no win there). Found 3 un-bridged switches: (1) ROCM_AITER_UNIFIED_ATTN backend is silently disqualified on gfx90a by the CDNA3-only is_aiter_found_and_supported() priority gate although it supports hd>=32/blk%16/bf16 — baseline runs plain vLLM Triton attention for the 16 full-attn layers (hd256 kills the CK paged kernel); bypassable config-only